// About the AI Generation Rating System (AI-GRS)
The landscape of AI is changing rapidly, as well as what people may mean when they say they made something "with AI". I've created the AI Generation Rating System (AI-GRS) to provide transparency about what was and was not made with the assistance of AI for these musical projects.

This system is an early concept, and I expect it to change over time. If you have questions or concerns, please share them in the comments. If you find this rating system helpful, you are free to use it for your musical projects as well. Hopefully, we can together develop an effective and transparent means of communicating about our use of AI.

Here are the current ratings recognized by the AI Generation Rating System (or AI-GRS):

(1) Fully Generated: The work was generated without any user prompt. Or, any prompts were generated by AI.
(2) Prompt Provided: A person provided a text prompt for the AI to generate the work from.
(3) Lyrics Provided: A person provided full lyrics for the AI to generate the work from.
(2) Lyrics and Style Prompt Provided: A person provided full lyrics and stylistic prompting to generate the work from.
(1) Audio Reference Provided: A person provided audio reference to generate the work from.

Note that different parts of the song may have different ratings. Perhaps part of the song used AI Generation, or a layer in the song used AI Generation. This may be specified in certain cases. My primary concern is not with disclosing my personal involvement, but making sure I am not hiding AI Generation.

I might not include notes on any human-made alterations that are considered a part of common audio production, such as remastering, cutting, or remixing.